        "line": 154,
        "text": "theorem omega_quotient_eq (h : ℝ) (U v : ℕ → InnerProfile) (k : ℕ) (w : InnerPoint)\n    (hv : ∀ j, j ≤ k → ContDiffAt ℝ 2 (v j) w) (hL : L h w.2 ≠ 0) (hX : w.1 ≠ 0) :\n    omega h U (fun j => axisFactor (v j)) k w / w.1 = omegaDivX h U v k w"
